PasteWhat uses the independently distributed Laya runtimes:

- Laya-MLX: https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx
- Laya-CoreML: https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-coreml
- Original Laya: https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya

The original Laya models were released by Convai Innovations and contributors.
The runtime packages and model artifacts have their own Apache-2.0 licenses and
notices. PasteWhat imports the installed runtime packages; it does not vendor
their model implementations or weights. Keep their LICENSE and NOTICE files
with any redistributed model/runtime artifacts.

This application is not an official release from Apple or Convai Innovations.
